1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,900
KiddoVerse!

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:02,930
Animal party!

3
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:03,860
Let's go!

4
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:07,800
Animals! Let's hear them all!

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:11,950
Moo, quack, oink, baa,
woof, meow, neigh, roar!

6
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:15,950
Come on, sing and dance with me!

7
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:19,950
Who says moo? The cow!

8
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:23,300
Moo, moo, moo!

9
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:27,950
The cow says moo! moo!

10
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:31,950
Who says quack? The duck!

11
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:35,300
Quack, quack, quack!

12
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:39,950
The duck says quack! quack!

13
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:43,950
Who says oink? The pig!

14
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:47,300
Oink, oink, oink!

15
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:51,950
The pig says oink! oink!

16
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:55,950
Who says baa? The sheep!

17
00:00:55,970 --> 00:00:59,300
Baa, baa, baa!

18
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:03,950
The sheep says baa! baa!

19
00:01:03,970 --> 00:01:07,950
Moo, quack, oink, baa,
woof, meow, neigh, roar!

20
00:01:07,970 --> 00:01:11,950
Come on, sing and dance with me!

21
00:01:11,970 --> 00:01:15,950
Who says woof? The dog!

22
00:01:15,970 --> 00:01:19,300
Woof, woof, woof!

23
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:23,950
The dog says woof! woof!

24
00:01:23,970 --> 00:01:27,950
Who says meow? The cat!

25
00:01:27,970 --> 00:01:31,300
Meow, meow, meow!

26
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:35,950
The cat says meow! meow!

27
00:01:35,970 --> 00:01:39,950
Who says neigh? The horse!

28
00:01:39,970 --> 00:01:43,300
Neigh, neigh, neigh!

29
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:47,950
The horse says neigh! neigh!

30
00:01:47,970 --> 00:01:51,950
Who says roar? The lion!

31
00:01:51,970 --> 00:01:55,300
Roar, roar, roar!

32
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:59,950
The lion says roar! roar!

33
00:01:59,970 --> 00:02:03,800
Flap, flap, like a duck!

34
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:07,800
Jump, jump, like a cat!

35
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:11,950
Stomp, stomp, like a lion! Roar!

36
00:02:11,970 --> 00:02:17,860
Who says quack?

37
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:19,950
Yes! It's the duck!

38
00:02:19,970 --> 00:02:25,860
Who says roar?

39
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,950
Yes! It's the lion!

40
00:02:27,970 --> 00:02:33,860
Who says oink?

41
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:35,950
Yes! It's the pig!

42
00:02:35,970 --> 00:02:39,800
Animals! Let's hear them all!

43
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:43,950
Moo, quack, oink, baa,
woof, meow, neigh, roar!

44
00:02:43,970 --> 00:02:47,950
Come on, sing and dance with me!

45
00:02:47,970 --> 00:02:51,950
Bye bye, animals! KiddoVerse!

46
00:02:51,970 --> 00:02:53,950
Bye bye, KiddoVerse!

47
00:02:53,970 --> 00:02:55,910
See you next time!

48
00:02:55,950 --> 00:02:58,250
Ask a grown-up to subscribe!

